# SUPERSEDED (2026-10-06) — kept for reference only.
#
# The single OPENAI_API_KEY has been split into two role-named secrets:
#   * CHAT_API_KEY       -> secrets/chat_api_key.txt       (DeepSeek, chat/LLM)
#   * EMBEDDING_API_KEY  -> secrets/embedding_api_key.txt  (Bailian, /embeddings)
#
# docker-compose.yml no longer mounts /run/secrets/openai_api_key.
# Do NOT create secrets/openai_api_key.txt for new deployments — use the two
# files above instead (see their .example files for instructions).
# ============================================================================
#
# Legacy content (no longer used):
#   cp secrets/openai_api_key.txt.example secrets/openai_api_key.txt
#   echo -n "sk-your-real-key-here" > secrets/openai_api_key.txt
#   -> mounted at /run/secrets/openai_api_key, read via OPENAI_API_KEY_FILE
sk-your-dashscope-api-key-here
